## 6. HTTPS enforcement & HSTS

If you ever terminate TLS in the app (or behind a reverse proxy), enable HSTS:

```js
app.use(
  helmet.hsts({
    maxAge: 31536000, // 1 year in seconds
    includeSubDomains: true,
    preload: true,
  })
);
```

If you’re behind a proxy (e.g., Nginx, Cloudflare), make sure Express trusts the proxy:

```js
app.set('trust proxy', 1); // needed for correct IP when rate limiting behind a proxy
```

